B.bkJ=s(["Apical 4-chamber view, LV focused","Add colour Doppler to visualise mitral inflow","PWD gate between MV annulus and tips \u2014 just inside LV","Freeze a short clip, move frame by frame in diastole","Confirm gate is NOT above or below annulus and tips","PWD gate should be more toward interventricular septal wall","Measure E wave (passive filling) and A wave (atrial contraction)","E/A = E peak velocity \xf7 A peak velocity"],t.s)
